{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/1ozqd43q","slide":5,"text":"Causal analysis starts with the immediate event and creates competing explanations for what directly allowed it.","textPreview":"Causal analysis starts with the immediate event and creates competing explanations for what directly allowed it.","textChars":112,"textLines":1,"bbox":[50,82,1090,28]}
